    'Frequently asked questions',
    '<b>Can diabetes or high blood pressure be cured?</b><br>They are usually long-term conditions that need ongoing care, but they can be kept within normal ranges with lifestyle changes and medicine as advised by your doctor, which greatly reduces the risk of complications.',
    '<b>I have no symptoms. Do I still need to be checked?</b><br>Yes, very much so. Both conditions usually have no early symptoms, and screening is the only way to find out in time.',
